# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Attending Pediatric Nephrologist, Module 29: Capstone: one child, every setting.
Written November 27, 2026 for the Renal Care Academy in the voice of the Physician on Duty modules. The capstone follows one
fictional child from a newborn with posterior urethral valves to an adolescent with a transplant. It has no separate evidence
section: each stage links back to the module that teaches it. Scoring: five areas, 0 to 2 each; pass 8 of 10 with every critical
action met. Module links use the pattern attending-pediatric-nephrologist-NN-slug.html. No doses. Every case is fictional."""

